+Exercise core, each applicable option including zero allowance, and jointly supported options together. Verify real activity and absence per observation. Include optional preparation, output, checkpointing, synchronization and completion in the measured boundary.
 
-In short, **growth bounds are enforced contracts; performance targets are observations, never gates.**
+Budget, binding and profile authority remains outside candidate code. Require current shared profile approval and admission. All three correct complete raw observations must fit the approved limit; report their maximum. Missing qualification, incomparable evidence, failed execution and misses cannot pass.
+
+Use `make profile`, owned adapters, [measurement rules](scripts/performance_measurement.py) and [profiling tests](tests/unit/test_transfer_profile_script.py). Matching diagnostic comparisons remain advisory. Measure the production implementation; do not introduce an alternate executor.
 
 ## Account for validation evidence
 
-Checks record their results and timing as they run, without repeating work just to measure it. The [shared qualification definitions](scripts/ci_qualification.py) identify the work and its conditions without replacing contracts owned by individual operations.
+Checks record results and timing as they run, without repeating work just to measure it. The [qualification definitions](scripts/ci_qualification.py) identify work and conditions without replacing operation contracts.
 
-Keep correctness, growth-contract conformance, and elapsed-time observations separate. Correctness failures, growth violations, and invalid required evidence fail validation. A valid timing miss does not.
+Correctness failures, growth violations, failed required budgets and invalid required evidence fail validation. Ordinary test or CI duration targets remain advisory; a valid miss does not block work or require approval.
 
-Report elapsed time even when no numerical target or comparable reference exists. Use credible performance evidence to recommend investigation or improvement. The stronger the evidence and the more serious its likely consequences, the stronger the recommendation may be.
-
-Record significant findings and recommendations in GitHub. Performance targets do not create approval-to-proceed conditions or authorize weakening required tests, workloads, or safety limits.
-
-In short, **validation evidence establishes compliance; performance observations inform judgment.**
+Record elapsed time without requiring a target or reference. Record significant findings in GitHub. Neither goals nor failures authorize weakening required tests, workloads or safety limits.
 
